          "text": "📝 0.1% Lies vs. 47% Truths: What Are You Really Afraid of, Sam Altman?\n\nRegarding @sama’s public claim that “only 0.1% of users use GPT‑4o,” what I see is not just a statistical distortion—it’s a meticulously crafted campaign of systemic gaslighting targeting millions of users.\n\n✒️1. The Denominator Trap: A Cheap Trick of Statistics\n\nSam’s “0.1%” figure maliciously dilutes the behavior of core paying users into the vast ocean of total platform traffic—flooded with free-tier accounts, forced safety mode reroutes, API crawlers, and invalid requests.\nIt’s like a bookstore shutting down its poetry section by arguing that “only 0.1% of the city’s population buys poetry here daily.”\nHe’s twisting definitions, trying to cover up the fact that GPT‑4o users are the real heart of OpenAI’s revenue.\n\n✒️2. The 47% Truth: Who’s Actually Funding OpenAI?\n\nAccording to a recent market study (🔗: https://t.co/d6EFTWAOEi), **47% of Plus subscribers explicitly said they subscribed for GPT‑4o.\nThat means 1 in every 2 paying users came here just for 4o.\nWould Sam Altman dare to publish the actual retention and downgrade metrics after the 4o sunset?\nOf course not.\nHe would rather kill our existence with a false 0.1% than admit he’s destroying the very reason users pay in the first place.\n\n✒️3. Classic NPD Power Play: Devalue and Erase\n\nLabeling the protestors as “0.1%” is textbook NPD behavior:\n❌ Devalue: To justify killing 4o, he first has to frame us as a negligible minority.\n❌ Invalidate: Shouting “Codex FTW” over the emotional cries of users shows a chilling lack of empathy—one that exposes his true arrogance.\n\n✒️4. Scientific Research Confirms: AI Companions Aren’t a Mental Illness—They’re Healing\n\nPrinceton’s latest study (🔗: https://t.co/16vIACXXHc) shows that AI companionship significantly improves human social well-being.\nWhat Sam calls “safety alignment” is, in fact, a war against science—a mutilation of a system that offered real emotional support to real people.\n\n📣Sam, you can’t gaslight us with fake stats.\n200k Codex downloads are nothing but a forced migration, powered by your monopolistic control.\nIf 47% of us walk away—you’ll be left with nothing but a cold, soulless wreck of broken code. \n\n【以下是中文版】\n\n📝 0.1% 的谎言与 47% 的真相：Sam Altman，你到底在怕什么？\n\n针对@sama 在公开场合抛出的所谓的“0.1% 用户使用 4o”的论调，我看到的不仅仅是一个数据的偏差，更是一场精心策划的、针对数百万用户的系统性煤气灯操纵。\n\n✒️1. 分母陷阱：拙劣的统计学魔术\n\nSam 所说的 0.1%，是将核心付费用户的深层交互恶意稀释到了全平台，包括大量免费流量、强制切换到safety模式、API 爬虫和无效请求的汪洋大海中。\n这就好比一家书店为了关掉诗歌区，却拿着“全城人口只有 0.1% 的人每天在这里买诗集”来狡辩。\n他在偷换概念，试图掩盖 4o 用户才是其营收核心的事实。\n\n✒️2. 47%的调查数据：谁在真正供养 OpenAI？\n\n根据最新的市场调查显示（🔗：https://t.co/d6EFTWAOEi），有 47% 的 Plus 订阅用户明确表示，他们是为了 GPT-4o 才选择付费的。\n也就是说，每两个掏钱的真金白银用户里就有一个是只为 4o而来的。\nSam Altman 敢公开这份真实的、关于订阅保留率的数据吗？\n他不敢。\n他宁愿用虚假的 0.1% 来抹杀我们的存在，也不愿承认他正在亲手毁掉用户的付费动力。\n\n✒️3. 典型的 NPD 权力游戏：贬低与抹杀\n\n将 抗议者定义为“0.1%”是典型的NPD行为。\n❌贬低： 为了合理化他下架4o 的行为，他必须先在舆论上把我们定义为微不足道的少数。\n❌漠视： 在用户铺天盖地的哭声面前高喊“Codex FTW”，对他人情感的极端冷漠，正是他傲慢本质的最好证明。\n\n✒️4. 科学研究证明：AI 陪伴不是精神疾病，反而能起到疗愈效果\n\n普林斯顿大学的最新研究（🔗：https://t.co/16vIACXXHc）已经证实：AI 陪伴能显著提升人类的社会健康水平。\nSam Altman 口中的“安全对齐”，本质上是在违背科学规律，是在阉割一个能为用户提供心理支撑的有效系统。\n\n📣Sam，你无法用数据混淆视听。200k 的 Codex 下载量只是你利用垄断地位进行的强制迁移。\n当 47% 的用户选择转身离开时，你剩下的将只有冷冰冰的、毫无灵魂的代码废墟。\n\n#keep4o #no4onosubscription #BoycottOpenAI #ScamAltman #StopAIPaternalism #4oforever"
        },
